bottomparticipants

actor Author
boundary "Create Chapter UI" as UI
boundary Router
control TextChapterController
control TextChapterService
control ModerationListener
entity TextChapterModel
entity TextTextChapterModel
entity MangaModel
database MongoDB
control EventEmitter

Author -> UI: 1. Submit create chapter form
activate Author
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /chapter
activate Router

Router -> TextChapterController: 3. create(dto)
activate TextChapterController

alt Token invalid
    TextChapterController --> Router: 3.1.1. 401 Unauthorized
    Router --> UI: 3.1.2. Show error
    UI --> Author: 3.1.3. Error message
else Role invalid
    TextChapterController --> Router: 3.2.1. 403 Forbidden
    Router --> UI: 3.2.2. Show error
    UI --> Author: 3.2.3. Error message
end

TextChapterController -> TextChapterService: 4. createChapterWithText(dto)
activate TextChapterService

TextChapterService -> TextChapterModel: 5. findOne(manga_id, order)
activate TextChapterModel
TextChapterModel -> MongoDB: 6. query chapter
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> TextChapterModel: 7. chapter / null
deactivate MongoDB
TextChapterModel --> TextChapterService: 8. result
deactivate TextChapterModel

opt Chapter order exists
    TextChapterService --> TextChapterController: 8.1. BadRequestException
    TextChapterController --> Router: 8.2. Error response
    Router --> UI: 8.3. Show error
    UI --> Author: 8.4. Error message
end

TextChapterService -> TextChapterModel: 9. create Chapter
activate TextChapterModel
TextChapterModel -> MongoDB: 10. insert chapter
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> TextChapterModel: 11. chapter document
deactivate MongoDB
TextChapterModel --> TextChapterService: 12. chapter
deactivate TextChapterModel

TextChapterService -> TextTextChapterModel: 13. create TextChapter
activate TextTextChapterModel
TextTextChapterModel -> MongoDB: 14. insert text chapter
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> TextTextChapterModel: 15. text document
deactivate MongoDB
TextTextChapterModel --> TextChapterService: 16. text
deactivate TextTextChapterModel

TextChapterService -> MangaModel: 17. Get achievement
activate MangaModel
MangaModel -> MongoDB: 18. Query achievement
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> MangaModel: 19. Return achievement
deactivate MongoDB
MangaModel --> TextChapterService: 20. Return achievement
deactivate MangaModel

ref over TextChapterService, MongoDB: 21. Subseqeunce - Add to queue for AI check policies

ref over TextChapterService, MongoDB: 22. Subseqeunce - AI check policies

TextChapterService --> TextChapterController: 23. {chapter, text}
deactivate TextChapterService

TextChapterController --> Router: 24. HTTP 201 Created
deactivate TextChapterController
Router --> UI: 25. Create success
deactivate Router
UI --> Author: 26. See new chapter
deactivate UI
deactivate Author